---
// A poster for a book swap: the weight axis at full stretch.
---

<figure class="poster" aria-label="Poster for a book swap">
  <div class="top">
    <p>Fjordby Bibliotek</p>
    <p>Byttemarked</p>
  </div>
  <p class="big" aria-label="Bog for bog">
    <span class="heavy">Bog</span>
    <span class="thin">for</span>
    <span class="heavy">bog</span>
  </p>
  <div class="bottom">
    <p class="when">Lørdag 7. marts<br />kl. 10–15</p>
    <p class="what">Tag en bog med, og gå hjem med en anden. Gratis adgang, kaffe i læsesalen.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .poster {
    --bg: #c2381c;
    --fg: #fbf7f5;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 5cqi, 2rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
    container-type: inline-size;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--fg);
  }
  .big {
    align-self: center;
    display: grid;
    font-size: 30cqi;
    line-height: 0.86;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-left: -0.05em;
  }
  .heavy {
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .thin {
    font-weight: 100;
    font-size: 0.62em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    padding-left: 0.08em;
  }
  .bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: end;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--fg);
  }
  .when {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 6cqi, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .what {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    max-width: 22em;
  }
</style>
